{"4886450":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hexzen","steam_appid":4886450,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4970090],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the clues, deduce every tile, and clear the board one step at a time. Hexzen is a hexagonal logic puzzle game played against shifting skies with a calm soundtrack. The puzzles require focus, but the environment is built to let you relax.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Read the board<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clue tells you how many adjacent or lining-up tiles you need to find. By marking what you know and ruling out what you don't, you can systematically clear the grid. The rules are easy to learn, but the puzzles grow to challenge your logic in new ways.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/d2916ae8d84653c0c3518657a7499bce.poster.avif?t=1793728778\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/d2916ae8d84653c0c3518657a7499bce.webm?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/d2916ae8d84653c0c3518657a7499bce.mp4?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parity and cipher variants<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the basic clues feel comfortable, the game starts bending them. Parity clues only reveal whether a count is even or odd. On cipher boards, the numbers are written in runes, and part of the puzzle is working out what each rune stands for. Both variants appear in the campaign and in generated puzzles.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The campaign: The Echo of the Runes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign takes you through multiple themed regions, starting with basic grids and moving toward more complex layouts. Each region introduces a new mechanic, such as mirrored boards. These handmade levels are designed to stretch your deductive skills with distinct logical setups.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/aa58217619b58941c11997e1c1acf36d.poster.avif?t=1793728778\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/aa58217619b58941c11997e1c1acf36d.webm?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/aa58217619b58941c11997e1c1acf36d.mp4?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite puzzles and daily challenges<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the campaign, you can generate custom puzzles whenever you want. You can set the difficulty for a quick match, or tackle the daily puzzle shared with all players.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Mode<\/strong>: Play custom puzzles at your preferred difficulty for as long as you like.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Puzzle<\/strong>: Solve a new board every day alongside other players.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shareable Seeds<\/strong>: Generate a specific puzzle and share its seed code with a friend.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own levels or full campaigns with the built-in editor, and share them with the community.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility and customization<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We built Hexzen to be accessible to as many players as possible, with options to customize the controls and interface.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization<\/strong>: The game is fully translated into 15 languages.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Settings<\/strong>: Choose from high-contrast modes, color-blind palettes, and a dyslexia-friendly font.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Controls<\/strong>: Play with mouse, keyboard, or controller.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Mode<\/strong>: Solve at your own pace, without the stress of making mistakes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the clues, deduce every tile, and clear the board one step at a time. Hexzen is a hexagonal logic puzzle game played against shifting skies with a calm soundtrack. The puzzles require focus, but the environment is built to let you relax.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Read the board<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clue tells you how many adjacent or lining-up tiles you need to find. By marking what you know and ruling out what you don't, you can systematically clear the grid. The rules are easy to learn, but the puzzles grow to challenge your logic in new ways.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/d2916ae8d84653c0c3518657a7499bce.poster.avif?t=1793728778\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/d2916ae8d84653c0c3518657a7499bce.webm?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/d2916ae8d84653c0c3518657a7499bce.mp4?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parity and cipher variants<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the basic clues feel comfortable, the game starts bending them. Parity clues only reveal whether a count is even or odd. On cipher boards, the numbers are written in runes, and part of the puzzle is working out what each rune stands for. Both variants appear in the campaign and in generated puzzles.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The campaign: The Echo of the Runes<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign takes you through multiple themed regions, starting with basic grids and moving toward more complex layouts. Each region introduces a new mechanic, such as mirrored boards. These handmade levels are designed to stretch your deductive skills with distinct logical setups.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/aa58217619b58941c11997e1c1acf36d.poster.avif?t=1793728778\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/aa58217619b58941c11997e1c1acf36d.webm?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/extras\/aa58217619b58941c11997e1c1acf36d.mp4?t=1793728778\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite puzzles and daily challenges<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the campaign, you can generate custom puzzles whenever you want. You can set the difficulty for a quick match, or tackle the daily puzzle shared with all players.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Mode<\/strong>: Play custom puzzles at your preferred difficulty for as long as you like.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily Puzzle<\/strong>: Solve a new board every day alongside other players.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shareable Seeds<\/strong>: Generate a specific puzzle and share its seed code with a friend.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Editor<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own levels or full campaigns with the built-in editor, and share them with the community.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility and customization<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We built Hexzen to be accessible to as many players as possible, with options to customize the controls and interface.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Localization<\/strong>: The game is fully translated into 15 languages.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Settings<\/strong>: Choose from high-contrast modes, color-blind palettes, and a dyslexia-friendly font.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Controls<\/strong>: Play with mouse, keyboard, or controller.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Mode<\/strong>: Solve at your own pace, without the stress of making mistakes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A hexagonal logic puzzle game set against shifting skies. Use logic alone to read the clues and clear each board. Master a handcrafted campaign, enjoy infinite custom puzzles, and shape your own challenges with the built-in level editor.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Czech, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/b138364c9c077dc931042c3c1f531582fdbe0af7\/header.jpg?t=1793728778","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/5311d446dffc09038f9621adf503d58b28c23e27\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728778","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/5311d446dffc09038f9621adf503d58b28c23e27\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728778","website":"http:\/\/apothema.net\/en\/hexzen\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core x86-64 @ 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Direct3D 12 or Vulkan 1.1 capable (e.g. Intel HD 520 \/ GeForce 900 series, ~2015+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core @ 2.5 GHz+<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU (GeForce GTX 1050 \/ Radeon RX 560 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11 Big Sur (Metal)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon (M1) or Intel Mac, 2015+<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any Metal-capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple Silicon integrated GPU or discrete AMD<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 64-bit distro, glibc 2.31+ (e.g. Ubuntu 20.04+), X11 or Wayland<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core x86-64 @ 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.1 drivers (Mesa 20+ \/ proprietary NVIDIA)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04+ or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core @ 2.5 GHz+<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU with up-to-date Vulkan drivers<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["Apothema"],"publishers":["Apothema"],"demos":[{"appid":4970090,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":899,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$9.99","final_formatted":"$8.99"},"packages":[1696503],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Hexzen","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1696503,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Hexzen - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99<\/span> $8.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":899}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":true},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":30,"description":"Steam Workshop"},{"id":64,"description":"Adjustable Text Size"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":82,"description":"#category_contrast_controls"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":71,"description":"Narrated Game Menus"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":17,"description":"Includes level editor"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"},{"id":63,"description":"Steam Timeline"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/ba4da4c17ed3ffc45f322601a5447034f8213d5d\/ss_ba4da4c17ed3ffc45f322601a5447034f8213d5d.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/ba4da4c17ed3ffc45f322601a5447034f8213d5d\/ss_ba4da4c17ed3ffc45f322601a5447034f8213d5d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793728778"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/d3bba2e8328b3b99a233f387db2f04d96a9e1473\/ss_d3bba2e8328b3b99a233f387db2f04d96a9e1473.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/d3bba2e8328b3b99a233f387db2f04d96a9e1473\/ss_d3bba2e8328b3b99a233f387db2f04d96a9e1473.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793728778"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/a866d9f2e1688702bca580f1f89e27a12d28111f\/ss_a866d9f2e1688702bca580f1f89e27a12d28111f.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/a866d9f2e1688702bca580f1f89e27a12d28111f\/ss_a866d9f2e1688702bca580f1f89e27a12d28111f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793728778"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/5e752074a8071a25264e69fbf20c78a0cd5a8bd4\/ss_5e752074a8071a25264e69fbf20c78a0cd5a8bd4.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/5e752074a8071a25264e69fbf20c78a0cd5a8bd4\/ss_5e752074a8071a25264e69fbf20c78a0cd5a8bd4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793728778"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/2aa2c5bfbd1c8aabdaab2479ea42f28b2445f2b6\/ss_2aa2c5bfbd1c8aabdaab2479ea42f28b2445f2b6.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/2aa2c5bfbd1c8aabdaab2479ea42f28b2445f2b6\/ss_2aa2c5bfbd1c8aabdaab2479ea42f28b2445f2b6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793728778"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/fe6528b3aa7de044e5f59f8533eaec4779b583c8\/ss_fe6528b3aa7de044e5f59f8533eaec4779b583c8.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/fe6528b3aa7de044e5f59f8533eaec4779b583c8\/ss_fe6528b3aa7de044e5f59f8533eaec4779b583c8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793728778"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/4418c6b4e035ea3421e32ccc3baa0e9d8f12f4f7\/ss_4418c6b4e035ea3421e32ccc3baa0e9d8f12f4f7.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/4418c6b4e035ea3421e32ccc3baa0e9d8f12f4f7\/ss_4418c6b4e035ea3421e32ccc3baa0e9d8f12f4f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793728778"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/5199f66d60424828b79c2eaa0844786ad96532ff\/ss_5199f66d60424828b79c2eaa0844786ad96532ff.600x338.jpg?t=1793728778","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4886450\/5199f66d60424828b79c2eaa0844786ad96532ff\/ss_5199f66d60424828b79c2eaa0844786ad96532ff.1920x1080.jpg?t=179